        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin PD005-ENTR/832xEMHT, 8.3\" Santa Monica Mortise Pocket Door Keyed Entry Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Large Santa Monica Pocket Door Keyed Entry Set comes with everything you need to add a keyed lock to any sliding door. The modern, rectangular plates make it a great choice for contemporary homes. It is available for 1-3/4 inch, 2 inch, 2-1/4 inch or 2-1/2 inch door thicknesses with a 2-1/2 inch backset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Pocket Door Keyed Lock:</b> Use when a lock is needed. Unlocked by a key from the outside and a thumbturn on the inside. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/large-santa-monica-pocket-door-passage-set-baldwin-pd005-pass\"><b>Passage Set</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/8-3-inch-santa-monica-pocket-door-privacy-set-baldwin-pd005-priv\"><b>Privacy Set</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"text\">\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Santa Monica Sliding Door Trim:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 2.3\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 8.3\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: .15\"</li>\r\n<li>Cup Width: 1.5\"</li>\r\n<li>Cup Height: 6.2\"</li>\r\n<li>Cup Depth: .29\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\", 2\", 2-1/4\" or 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Case Height: 6-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Case Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Case Depth: 3-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Case Material: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Edge Face Height: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Edge Face Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Finger Pull: is thrown by pressing the button on the mortise faceplate. It can be retracted simply by pressing it flush with the faceplate.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/baldwin-8602-template.pdf?v=1691094971\" target=\"new\"><b>Baldwin Mortise Lock Installation Template (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BAL-PD005-specifications.gif?v=1704354560\" width=\"174\" height=\"264\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Baldwin PD005 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Set:</b> two (2) rectangle flush pulls, a keyed mortise, and all mounting hardware. <b>For One (1) Door.</b>\r\n</p>",
